# Pure SaaS: /pure-saas component

Build or improve robust, accessible, reusable UI components aligned with the design system.

## Usage
Type `@pure-saas-component [request]` or `/pure-saas component [request]` in Composer or Chat.

## Instructions
1. Inspect existing components to prevent duplicating components or conflicting APIs.
2. Bind all styling to semantic tokens in `DESIGN.md`. Reject hardcoded hex colors and arbitrary spacing.
3. Fully implement the 8-state matrix: `default`, `hover`, `focus-visible`, `active`, `disabled`, `loading`, `empty`, and `error/success`.
4. Ensure built-in keyboard navigation, visible focus offset, and ARIA roles.
5. Provide clean component APIs with typed variants, composition, and ref forwarding.
